{"id":"df1066ccd01cf082","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fhodtt-syntax-compat.md","title":"fhodtt-syntax — 两 sort 形成接口的历史入口","display":"fhodtt-syntax — 两 sort 形成接口的历史入口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax-compat","aliases":["16-df-fhodtt-syntax-compat","16-fhodtt-syntax"],"display":"fhodtt-syntax — 两 sort 形成接口的历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]"],"review_status":"source-rule-core-reconstructed","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J04","review_date":"2026-10-16","source":"§11.5, pp. 685–689 (PDF 705–709)","review_scope":"Compatibility alias for the reconstructed core formation interface","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fhodtt-syntax-compat</span><span>16-fhodtt-syntax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fhodtt-syntax — 两 sort 形成接口的历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca2d757f82798122\" href=\"?note=ca2d757f82798122\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-syntax\">16-df-fhodtt-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"source-rule-core-reconstructed"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J04"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.5, pp. 685–689 (PDF 705–709)"},{"key":"review_scope","html":"Compatibility alias for the reconstructed core formation interface"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2d757f82798122\" href=\"?note=ca2d757f82798122\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-syntax\">16-df-fhodtt-syntax</a> 明确定义的有限表达式、混合语境、和消去 sort 许可及形成规则记录；上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{legacy}\">\\(\\mathrm{legacy}\\)</span> 区分历史拼写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Syntax}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Syntax}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：§11.5，pp. 685–689（PDF 705–709）。这次补上了原入口曾引用但规范文件没有定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\)</span>；语法以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span> 与四种依赖为核心。</li>\n<li>项与转换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a>。本入口不把一般 DTT 签名、宇宙层级或额外 Prop 当作书中 FhoDTT 的形成结构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}$ 是 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]] 明确定义的有限表达式、混合语境、和消去 sort 许可及形成规则记录；上标 $\\mathrm{legacy}$ 区分历史拼写。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"项与转换见 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]。本入口不把一般 DTT 签名、宇宙层级或额外 Prop 当作书中 FhoDTT 的形成结构。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{legacy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Syntax}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false}],"bytes":1343,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax-compat|fhodtt-syntax — 两 sort 形成接口的历史入口]]"}],"outgoing":["ca2d757f82798122","3930e297a315728a"]}